known_issues:
  - "The rendered robots are served by the plugin's dashboard half, which mounts when the gateway starts. Right after install the board shows flat robots and a Restart gateway button; one restart switches them over."
  - "The themes' customCSS styles four app data-slot names; if a Desktop release renames one, that rule stops applying and the palette alone remains."
  - "Verified by hand on macOS (Apple silicon) with Hermes Desktop 0.23.0. Linux and Windows run the same code and plugin directories but were not exercised."
